IMPORTANT NOTICE:

This plugin ("multi-review") orchestrates agents from external plugins.
This license applies ONLY to the multi-review plugin code itself.

External plugins that multi-review depends on may have their own licensing terms:

- feature-dev, pr-review-toolkit: Official Anthropic plugins (included with Claude Code)
- superpowers: Third-party plugin (NOT open source)

Users are responsible for ensuring they have rights to use all required plugins
and for complying with each plugin's individual licensing terms.

See DEPENDENCIES.md for complete information on required plugins.
